  "cause": [
    "Modern OpenATV constructs EPGSelectionGrid through EPGSelection.__new__. The patched legacy EPGSelection.__init__ therefore does not create warder_key_* sources.",
    "RefreshColouredKeys was removed from the new API. The unguarded lookup raises AttributeError, swallowed by the outer except Exception: pass, and installation stops before the custom button handlers.",
    "The XML still renders the four custom warder_key_* sources; without their creation, all four captions remain absent."
